<h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>

<h3>Intro & Scope</h3>
<p>
  These terms describe the rules for using this service. 
  By texting a request to this number, you agree to the terms below. 
  This is an independent, unofficial service and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or operated by LA Metro (LACMTA).
<p>

<h3>What this service does</h3>
<p>
  You send a text with a bus line number (e.g. "LACMTA 420") and receive a reply with estimated arrival times. 
  No account, no signup or no ongoing messages beyond your reply.
</p>

<h3>Message frequency</h3>
<p>
  You receive one reply per message you send. We do not send unsolicited messages.
</p>

<h3>Accuracy</h3>
